			description: [
				"&eSix iron, a dropper and a pinch of redstone dust makes sixteen Item Pipes.&r"
				""
				"Run one from your sieve outputs into the drawer wall and the sorting problem solves itself while you're asleep. Wrench the end touching the source and set it to extract."
