				"One of each pipe, two iron and a redstone block, and the three become one: the &eUniversal Pipe&r carries items, fluids, energy and gas through the same block."
				""
				"Each side still configures independently, so a single run down your machine wall can extract items, deliver power and take fluid away at once. Six per craft - use them where the wall gets crowded."
