		{
			dependencies: ["7E10000000000003"]
			description: [
				"A bare pipe moves a trickle. &eUpgrades&r slot into each side's wrench config to raise the transfer rate and unlock more filter slots."
				""
				"&eBasic&r is iron and redstone. &eImproved&r wraps it in gold. Put one in every extracting side you care about - an unupgraded pipe out of a sieve will fall behind the sieve."
			]
