				"The top of the ladder: &eAdvanced&r takes diamonds, &eUltimate&r takes netherite. An Ultimate-upgraded side moves more than any early machine can produce."
				""
				"Fit these where throughput actually matters - ore processing lines, power backbones, AE2 and Refined Storage feeds - and stop thinking about pipes for the rest of the pack."
