		{
			dependencies: ["7E10000000000009"]
			description: [
				"Pipez is not the only way to move an item, and the alternatives are worth knowing before you commit a whole base to one style."
				""
				"&ePretty Pipes&r are cheap, filterable, and come with something Pipez doesn't have: an &eItem Terminal&r that shows every connected inventory in one searchable window, and a &eCrafting Terminal&r that crafts from all of them at once."
				""
				"That is AE2-style convenience out of plain chests, available long before AE2 is realistic."
			]
