			description: [
				"&eModular Routers&r throws out the idea of a pipe run entirely."
				""
				"One &eRouter&r block holds up to nine &emodules&r, and each module is a job: pull from a chest, push to a machine, place a block, break a block, vacuum up drops, activate a tool, fling items across a gap."
				""
				"A single router bolted to a wall can replace a whole pipe network. It is the cheapest \"oh, that's easy\" moment in the pack - build one and see how much of your base it quietly absorbs."
